@startuml
' Palette: usecase; based on the Visual Paradigm guide samples (see README).
skinparam defaultFontColor #111111
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam ActorBorderColor #222222
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9D9
skinparam NoteBorderColor #555555
skinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #222222
skinparam UsecaseBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam UsecaseBorderColor #222222
skinparam RectangleBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #222222
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 40
top to bottom direction
actor Admin
rectangle "StudyFlow — Admin" #7ACFF5 {
usecase "Quản lý tài khoản\nvà vai trò" as users
usecase "Quản lý Subject" as subjects
usecase "Quản lý Semester" as semesters
usecase "Giám sát Course Offering" as offerings
usecase "Xử lý feedback" as feedback
usecase "Xem audit / trạng thái AI" as audit
usecase "Quản lý cấu hình hệ thống" as settings
users -[hidden]down-> subjects
subjects -[hidden]down-> semesters
offerings -[hidden]down-> feedback
feedback -[hidden]down-> audit
audit -[hidden]down-> settings
semesters -[hidden]down-> offerings
}
Admin -right- users
Admin -[norank]- subjects
Admin -[norank]- semesters
Admin -[norank]- offerings
Admin -[norank]- feedback
Admin -[norank]- audit
Admin -[norank]- settings
note bottom of offerings
Không phân công Teacher từng lớp;
không quản lý Quiz, Progress
hoặc đọc Personal PDF của Student.
end note
@enduml
